WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:05.150
<i>With our hearts set on joining AKB0048,</i>

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.360
<i>we left our home planet behind,</i>

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:13.950
<i>and found ourselves saved from an
anti-entertainment DES attack by 0048.</i>

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:19.580
Look at all these girls!

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.660
Are all of them participating in the selection round?

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:30.800
She's so beautiful.

00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:32.050
Yeah.

00:00:32.630 --> 00:00:34.300
Welcome.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:39.560
I am AKB0048's manager and producer, Katagiri Tsubasa.

00:00:40.470 --> 00:00:41.310
Manager?

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:47.560
You will be going through the selection process for the 77th generation.

00:00:47.560 --> 00:00:51.610
Only those who pass will become understudies

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:55.740
and be invited to our planet,
the home of 00 Stage, Akibastar.

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:58.740
Akibastar...

00:00:58.740 --> 00:01:01.490
The theme of this audition will be "Beginner".

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:07.000
The successful performance of
"Beginner" is the criterion for passing.

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.210
I love that song!

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:14.090
The choreography is tricky, though.

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:14.920
Yeah.

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:19.510
I-I can probably handle "Beginner", I think...

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:21.560
Pay attention to what I said.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:24.890
A <i>successful performance</i> is necessary for you to pass, understand?

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:27.350
A successful... performance?

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:32.190
You will now be undergoing
a round of intensive training.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.030
Okey-dokey!

00:01:34.030 --> 00:01:35.780
Don't fall behind, girls!

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:38.780
Here!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:42.620
A mic?

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:51.290
Not quite! Meet the assault micsaber!

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.050
What?!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:57.130
Practice time. Hurry along now!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:03.010
And who are you?

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:04.430
Sonata.

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:06.390
I'm participating in the selection round!

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.320
Go ahead.

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:26.290
<i>Our scattering sweat shall turn into song.</i>

00:02:26.290 --> 00:02:29.540
<i>Our flowing tears shall turn into stars.</i>

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:45.140
Even if you reach out your hand,

00:02:45.100 --> 00:02:51.690
you won't be able to reach it yet.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:57.280
Our dreams still lie

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:02.870
much, much further in the distance.

00:02:58.070 --> 00:02:59.110
Akimoto Sayaka the 10th

00:02:58.110 --> 00:02:59.110
Takahashi Minami the 5th

00:02:59.200 --> 00:02:59.990
Itano Tomomi the 11th

00:02:59.320 --> 00:02:59.900
Ooshima Yuuko the 9th

00:03:00.070 --> 00:03:00.860
Kashiwagi Yuki the 6th

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:00.950
Kojima Haruna the 8th

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:01.610
Miyazawa Sae the 10th

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:01.610
Watanabe Mayu MK3

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:01.910
Maeda Atsuko the 13th

00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:06.740
Even the stars of the sky

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:15.880
shining beyond the shadows.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:22.140
Let me speak of hope,

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:28.220
like a nameless poet: with passion.

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:26.430
you ni

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:28.220
atsuku

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:34.270
If you find yourself broken down in tears,

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:34.270
kimi ga namida ni kureteiru nara

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:39.740
then rather than consoling you,

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:39.740
nagusame yori mo yagate shiramu

