let me speak of the coming dawn.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:46.410
sora wo katarou ka

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:56.340
- Stardust Selection-

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:01.590
Th-These are...

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.090
idol...

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.760
lessons?!

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:16.150
In ten days, AKB0048 will be holding a guerrilla concert on this planet.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:21.740
Meanwhile, you will train until you can protect the current successors without fail.

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.860
You mean we'll be battling at this concert?

00:04:23.860 --> 00:04:26.200
You'll be bodyguards, no more.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:30.080
If the enemy craft are manned,
you are forbidden to use lethal force.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:31.790
Oh yeah.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:36.630
Back then, the members had to fight, didn't they?

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:39.460
You're telling <i>us</i> to do that?

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.960
No way, no way! That's totally impossible!

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.840
In that case, your journey ends here.

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:48.180
If you intend to perform on planets where entertainment is banned,

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.770
you must learn how to defend yourselves.

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:52.430
That's right.

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:54.100
This is no ordinary selection round.

00:04:54.980 --> 00:04:56.560
If you cannot surmount this challenge,

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:59.770
then you'll only join 0048 at the cost of your life.

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:03.030
"Beginner" will be this performance's finale.

00:05:03.030 --> 00:05:06.280
You must guard the concert until the last note is sung.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.280
That is your selection round!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:16.500
Oh, I'm soaked in sweat.

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.670
It could "cost us our lives", huh?

00:05:19.670 --> 00:05:21.340
Things have gotten dark all of a sudden.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:23.170
Yeah...

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.300
What is this? Rust?!

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.470
You just gotta do it right.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:33.180
First, let all the rust wash out.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:34.350
Hot!

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:37.020
Then, slowly turn down the water.

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:43.070
I see.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.200
Not that one!

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.700
The second one from the left is rusty, no matter what you do.

00:05:55.080 --> 00:05:58.290
I'm so tired, I'm not even hungry...

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.040
Yeah...

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:02.040
Come on, it's time to eat!

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:03.000
Go on!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:03.880
Here!

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.670
An idol's body is her primary asset!

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.470
Gotta eat to maintain it!

00:06:08.470 --> 00:06:10.600
Go ahead! Dig right in!

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.350
Um...

00:06:11.930 --> 00:06:13.430
This is part of your training!

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:26.280
The fatty part of the meat is too rich.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:27.650
I can't take it...

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.780
I'm supposed to be on a diet...

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.670
Aw man, we're sleeping in <i>here?</i>

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:44.630
I foresee a restless night.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:50.180
Oh, I'll never make it back alive!

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:51.590
I'd better write my will while I still can...

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:54.140
You're always grumbling, Makoto.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:57.850
Your nickname is now officially Grumbly!

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:58.640
"Grumbly"?!

00:06:58.640 --> 00:07:01.650
It wasn't supposed to be like this...

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:02.770
Orine.

00:07:02.770 --> 00:07:05.610
I only wanted to be an idol.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:06.360
You said it.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:08.490
I wanted to sing, dance, and sparkle,

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:13.030
not crawl around fighting and get covered in sweat.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:14.490
Quit whining.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.410
Why don't you go home then?

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.830
If that's the attitude you're going to take, then you're just wasting everyone's time.

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:22.540
Chieri?

00:07:23.750 --> 00:07:25.880
I'm going to go sleep in the lobby.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:30.050
What's <i>her</i> problem?

00:07:30.050 --> 00:07:31.760
Wait up, Chieri!

00:07:32.760 --> 00:07:35.220
Nagisa! Nagisa!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.350
Nagisa! Come on, Nagisa!

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.890
Give it up! Just leave her alone.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.900
Listen, Nagisa!

00:07:42.900 --> 00:07:45.360
But... we had a dream—

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.770
She wasn't like that before!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.280
Chieri's changed.

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.320
But...

00:07:55.320 --> 00:07:56.580
Is that...

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.750
All of my past experience

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:02.750
kinou made no keiken to ka

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.750
and knowledge will just weigh me down.

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:05.750
chishiki nanka nimotsu na dake

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.750
The wind will blow as always,

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:08.750
kaze wa itsumo doori sugite

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:11.760
