00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.420
We're always like this.

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:27.330
Always?

00:09:27.330 --> 00:09:30.290
Yep. We let each other know what we think

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:32.420
and correct each other's mistakes.

00:09:32.420 --> 00:09:35.260
That way, we can put on our best performance.

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.840
Even if we hit a dead end,

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:39.140
<i>Try again! Try again!</i>

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:42.350
<i>You'll figure it out somehow!</i>

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.810
Oh, you...

00:09:49.520 --> 00:09:52.070
So they <i>weren't</i> fighting.

00:09:52.070 --> 00:09:56.400
